    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">DP on two strings</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/edit-distance/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 72</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Edit Distance</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Only the last characters need a decision: if they match, d[i][j] = d[i-1][j-1]; otherwise it is 1 + min(replace d[i-1][j-1], delete d[i-1][j], insert d[i][j-1]). Fill a (m+1) × (n+1) table of prefixes; two rows are enough. O(m·n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
  },
